# The providers that run only on the pi harness, with an API key (read by shared/runtime/provider-models.js, the CLI,
# and .launcher/role-models.sh, the launcher; one table, no copy). The model of each role comes from the class the role
# has in role-models.list (sol | terra | luna): the same classes, another provider's models.
# provider|name for pi (--provider)|variable of the key|label
provider|glm|zai|ZAI_API_KEY|GLM (Z.ai)
provider|kimi|moonshotai|MOONSHOT_API_KEY|Kimi (Moonshot)
provider|claude|anthropic|ANTHROPIC_API_KEY|Claude (Anthropic)
# model|provider|class|model id in pi
# GLM: 5.3 where the work is hard, 5.3-Flash (ten times cheaper) for the light roles.
model|glm|sol|glm-5.3
model|glm|terra|glm-5.3
model|glm|luna|glm-5.3-flash
# rolemodel|provider|role|class: the class a role has on THIS provider instead of its own in role-models.list. A pin in the config
# (team.role_models.<role>.model) still wins. The roles that read, search and extract (scout, analista, sentinella) are the ones
# that make most of the calls (about 3 in 4 on a measured run of the burst); the judgement (scorer) and the roles that talk to the person stay on 5.3.
rolemodel|glm|scout|luna
rolemodel|glm|analista|luna
rolemodel|glm|sentinella|luna
rolemodel|kimi|scout|luna
rolemodel|kimi|analista|luna
rolemodel|kimi|sentinella|luna
rolemodel|claude|capitano|terra
# The Mentor too: it reads and writes a digest, and on Opus (twice the price of Sonnet) one start cost 0.30 $ of a 1.97 $ run.
rolemodel|claude|mentor|terra
rolemodel|claude|scout|luna
rolemodel|claude|analista|luna
rolemodel|claude|sentinella|luna
# OpenAI (pi with a key, and Codex) takes its models from role-models.list; the same three light roles on luna.
rolemodel|openai|scout|luna
rolemodel|openai|analista|luna
rolemodel|openai|sentinella|luna
# Kimi: K3.1 Pro for every class, luna too: the account lists only kimi-k3, kimi-k3.1-pro and kimi-k3.1-pro-highspeed (no K2 model).
model|kimi|sol|kimi-k3.1-pro
model|kimi|terra|kimi-k3.1-pro
model|kimi|luna|kimi-k3.1-pro
# Claude (Anthropic) on pi, only with an API key (a Claude subscription used from pi is billed as extra usage): Opus where the
# work is hard, Sonnet in the middle, Haiku for the light roles.
model|claude|sol|claude-opus-5-5
model|claude|terra|claude-sonnet-5-5
model|claude|luna|claude-haiku-5-5
